    "html": "<p>Thermal energy is transferred through a copper rod at a rate of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"800\\: \\textup{W}\"></span>. The cross-sectional area of the rod is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.010\\: \\textup{m}^{2}\"></span> and the length of the rod is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\: \\textup{cm}\"></span>. There is a constant temperature difference of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\\: \\textup{K}\"></span> between the two ends of the rod.</p>\n<p>What is the thermal conductivity of copper?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\\:\\textup{W}\\,\\textup{m}^{-1}\\,\\textup{K}^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"200\\:\\textup{W}\\,\\textup{m}^{-1}\\,\\textup{K}^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"400\\:\\textup{W}\\,\\textup{m}^{-1}\\,\\textup{K}^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"800\\:\\textup{W}\\,\\textup{m}^{-1}\\,\\textup{K}^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
